# Minimal session for INCURSION_LOF_PROBE (inc-30ps phase 2,
# Creature::LineOfFireProbe, src/Fight.cpp). The probe runs once,
# synchronously, at the very top of Game::Play() -- before the arrival
# screen chargen.keys leaves up is even dismissed -- so nothing after
# chargen.keys matters to the check itself; this script only needs a clean,
# deterministic way into a live map and a clean exit.
#
# Read by tools/check_line_of_fire.sh, which sets INCURSION_LOF_PROBE=1 and
# reads the probe's own PASS/FAIL lines out of logs/errors.log.

@include chargen.keys

SPACE*80
ESC*20

@quit
